# Constraint Model

Future core work (DND-1.2+) defines content constraints and validity.

- Prefer renderer-agnostic vocabulary over HTML/CSS semantics in core.
- Validity states and scoring belong in core, not in React components.
- Do not invent persistence schemas early; future saved layouts must include `schemaVersion`.
- DND-1.1 must not implement LayoutNode semantics, minUsefulWidth, or VALID/DEGRADED/INVALID logic.
